  "description": "ROHVUI crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C56 H68 Dy4 F6 N10 O20 P2 2+,2(C1 H4 O1),0.3(H2 O1),2(Cl1 1-). From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy4 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 4 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 4.060-4.233 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 112.19-117.92°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C57.7H76Cl2Dy4F6N10O22.3P2.",
